{"id":"n49262-1-8","stage":3,"title":"클래식 · 古典音乐","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49262-1-8-1","ko":"그 레스토랑에 자주 가시는 것 같아요.","zh":"您好像经常去那家餐厅呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"레스토랑에","meaning":"西餐厅","explanation":"레스토랑：西餐厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"레스토랑","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52573","senseId":"1","lemma":"레스토랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가시는","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"98acfd757481a16c","term":"레스토랑","zh":"西餐厅","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3","entryId":"52573","definition":"出售西餐的餐馆。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"604b383d216f9452","term":"자주","zh":"常常，经常","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3","entryId":"71199","definition":"重复做同样事情的间隔短暂地。","pronunciation":["자주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/831d41056ad0bbe0d929.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49262-1-8-2","ko":"그곳에서는 와인을 마시며 클래식 연주도 들을 수 있거든요.","zh":"因为在那儿可以边喝葡萄酒边听古典音乐哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그곳에서는","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"그곳：那儿，那里；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그곳","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17207","senseId":"2","lemma":"그곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와인을","meaning":"红酒，葡萄酒","explanation":"와인：红酒，葡萄酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"와인","audio":"/audio/0b5661b6eebdebf773fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67845","senseId":"1","lemma":"와인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마시며","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"클래식","meaning":"古典音乐","explanation":"클래식：古典音乐","readings":[{"term":"클래식","audio":"/audio/6514ada5a92281d90d5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49262","senseId":"1","lemma":"클래식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연주도","meaning":"演奏","explanation":"연주：演奏；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"연주","audio":"/audio/9c951c9c34a78317b25a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14024","senseId":"1","lemma":"연주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들을","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있거든요.","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"093e0b955cac9280","term":"그곳","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/093e0b955cac928053f8.mp3","entryId":"17207","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["그곧"]},{"id":"0b5661b6eebdebf7","term":"와인","zh":"红酒，葡萄酒","audio":"/audio/0b5661b6eebdebf773fb.mp3","entryId":"67845","definition":"发酵葡萄汁制成的洋酒。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"6514ada5a92281d9","term":"클래식","zh":"古典音乐","audio":"/audio/6514ada5a92281d90d5e.mp3","entryId":"49262","definition":"根据西洋传统作曲法创作并用其演奏法演奏的音乐。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9c951c9c34a78317","term":"연주","zh":"演奏","audio":"/audio/9c951c9c34a78317b25a.mp3","entryId":"14024","definition":"使用乐器演奏音乐。","pronunciation":["연ː주"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"i